    description: Some("Two arcade conversions on one cartridge. Super Breakout is the bat-and-ball wall-smasher, offering Progressive, which scrolls the wall down at you, Doubles, and Cavity for multiple balls at once. Battlezone puts you in a tank cockpit instead, hunting enemy tanks, missiles and saucers by sight and radar while they hunt you."),
